===GAME START===
EXT. THEMYSCIRA - RESTING AREA - DAY

ALEX finds a serene spot under a large, ancient tree, its branches providing shade from the warm sun. The sounds of nature surround them, creating a peaceful atmosphere. After an intense training session, ALEX knows it’s important to take a moment to rest and recover.

ALEX
(sighing contentedly)
This is just what I need.

As ALEX settles down, they close their eyes, allowing their mind to drift. They reflect on their journey so far—the challenges faced, the victories won, and the bonds formed with the Amazons. 

A gentle breeze rustles the leaves, and ALEX feels a sense of calm wash over them. They take deep breaths, letting go of any tension in their body. 

After some time, ALEX opens their eyes, feeling rejuvenated and ready to face whatever comes next. They stretch, feeling the energy returning to their limbs.

ALEX
(smiling)
I’m ready to take on new challenges!

With renewed vigor, ALEX stands up, ready to rejoin their fellow Amazons and continue their journey as a warrior.

===GAME END===

